comments.body:
FYI, to other reviewers, this change is **NOT** a breaking change, since the `createCssStyles` function is not exported publicly in the `mermaidAPI` object.

Although, this is a bit confusing, so maybe in a future PR we should move `createCssStyles` out of the `mermaidAPI.ts` file.

@sidharthv96, do you think it makes sense to mark this function as [`@internal`](https://tsdoc.org/pages/tags/internal/) so that it doesn't appear on the https://mermaid.js.org/config/setup/modules/mermaidAPI.html page? (this can be done in another PR).
